The package installs zcode-app-cli 3.15.3-37 as a pinned dependency. That community
client packages the official ZCode agent runtime and its compatibility layer. Its
own license and the runtime's Apache-2.0 and third-party notices remain in that
dependency. No upstream vendor source or user credential store is copied into the
ZC source archive. Inspect the installed dependency's LICENSE and LICENSES files.

The optional installers acquire an unmodified Node.js distribution with its own
license notices. Runtime and engine bytes are downloaded at install time rather
than embedded in the small ZC installation ZIP.

